; ==============================================================================
; FILE: projects/albums/the-stardust-engine/1996-ad-astra-single/1996-ad-astra-single.rsip
; ALBUM EDITION: Escape Velocity (Ad Astra) - The Stardust Engine (The Stardust Engine)
; LAYOUT: 640x480 16:9 OpenGraph CD-Autorun Micro-Installer (Per-User Vault)
